  <item>
    <title>Vol.016 芭比、许沁、马和妇科检查</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64db86cc80c9ec4c5f59c4e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64db86cc80c9ec4c5f59c4e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Aug 2023 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们聊了聊关于《芭比》的电影内容、导演与演员、同场观众的反应，并且由此引申，聊到了部分观众看不惯肯这一角色背后的原因，以及电影中与父权制相关联的内容。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看看</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>海豹</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>叉叉</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> -从路透直接到上映，《芭比》你是一点宣发没有啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="221">03:41</a> -同场观众的反应——真不至于看个电影就破防</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> -关于最出圈的那一大段台词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> -这么温和的电影，怎么有这么两极的评论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> -肯和许沁——都是纯爱舔狗，怎么有点不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> -“你很美”，“我知道”，这是只有女性才能懂的温暖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> -经验之谈——芭比做完妇科检查，可能再也不会这么开心了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> -“马”在西方文化语境中和父权的关联</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> -印象深刻的笑话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> -现实中，我们遇到的“让我肯肯你”的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a> -在芭比的世界里，每个芭比都无条件被爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> -学西语的丈夫，究竟是木讷还是恳切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> -电影提出哲学问题，却常常给不了答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">55:55</a> -《芭比》尽力了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书影音：</span></strong><span>《芭比》《嘉年华》《触觉文化史》《伯德小姐》《婚姻故事》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>制作人：靳看看</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgpf6_CQG0OLxEAsyCUCXkPBWzCW.m4a" length="58611932" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszO3Ey6EzTGMWfrI6ighpET5hsq.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.015 在毕业典礼这天 聊聊清华美院毕业展</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6496a5f2932f350aaef1722f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6496a5f2932f350aaef1722f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Jun 2023 08:14:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>展览前夕作品被下架、毕业生集体写联名信、与美院物业立下生死状、作品被前来参观的小朋友打碎……</span></p><span></span><p><span>在今年的清华美院毕业展中，究竟能有哪些“幺蛾子”呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看看（微博/小宇宙/小红书@靳看看）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>老李（小宇宙@木子王月㝉旦）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>首绳（哈哈哈）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>椰奶（公众号@任意门童/小宇宙@亍彳）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> -老李的自画像——磅礴的绘画&amp;重复的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> -首绳的海螺——陶瓷系终于有可互动的作品了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a> -我们要开麦吐槽了：关于偌大的清华艺术博物馆，却容不下一届学生的毕业展这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> -展览的极限前摇——联名信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1967">32:47</a>-心痛预警：前来参观的小朋友，摔碎了雕塑系毕业生的大件作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2083">34:43</a> -展览前夕，物业居然偷偷让我们签了生死状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> -清美学子毕业后，要去做什么呢？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>制作人：@靳看看</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls5svt6gaT7nqJu-gPYBZYRxogh2.m4a" length="37326160" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszO3Ey6EzTGMWfrI6ighpET5hsq.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.014 和清华影协一起聊聊《宇宙探索编辑部》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646c877953a5e5ea14d8fdca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646c877953a5e5ea14d8fdca</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2023 09:29:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本次录音我们邀请到了来自清华大学电影协会的两位嘉宾——杏仁和Tom，一起聊一聊《宇宙探索编辑部》中那些我们觉得喜欢的、觉得已经很好的和可以更好的内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家订阅清华影协播客——周四画外音，以及影协公众号——清华大学电影协会。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>杏仁</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>Tom</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>看看</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>海豹</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>叉叉</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a></span></strong><span> -观影体验——晕了，爱了，离场了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a></span></strong><span> -你闭眼了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a></span></strong><span> -拍摄手法——是伪纪录片，但也确实是像老唐另一个人格的视角</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a></span></strong><span> -关于电影中的神性成分</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a></span></strong><span> -啊，这个结尾，嘶，啊这</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a></span></strong><span> -到底有没有外星人啊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a></span></strong><span> -电影的角色设置像是很多人的家庭缩影</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a></span></strong><span> -电影中没有的女性主义</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a></span></strong><span> -电影中很有的理想主义</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">39:48</a></span></strong><span> -这几个年轻人的角色，是非有不可吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a></span></strong><span> -“驴子”的隐喻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2782">46:22</a></span></strong><span> -章回体——这是可以讲的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a></span></strong><span> -电影提出哲学问题，却常常给不了答案</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3317">55:17</a></span></strong><span> -观众的情绪在角色和解时终结</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3596">59:56</a></span></strong><span> -剧本的创作故事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3766">1:02:46</a></span></strong><span> -叠甲时刻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3818">1:03:38</a></span></strong><span> -浪漫理想与乡土情怀——不够北京，但很四川</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4114">1:08:34</a></span></strong><span> -电影里的诗歌——正确的词引导人，不正确的词使人着迷</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4326">1:12:06</a></span></strong><span> -悲恸表面的虚浮快乐——一些喜剧情节</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书影音：</span></strong><span>《宇宙探索编辑部》、《伦敦生活》、《瞬息全宇宙》、《醉乡民谣》、《海边的曼彻斯特》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>制作人：</span></strong><span>靳看看</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrisWv_x5tPtjAZVWG_2_O_C09hZ.m4a" length="109340084" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszO3Ey6EzTGMWfrI6ighpET5hsq.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.013 宿舍关系——讲究的就是一个错综复杂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6453b7c17d934b850598b0da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6453b7c17d934b850598b0da</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 May 2023 13:48:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>宿舍生活是很多学生都注定要经历的，在住宿之前，每个人都会对自己的宿舍生涯充满畅想，而当真正进入到宿舍生活时，才会发现——还是自己太年轻，想得太简单了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看看（微博/小宇宙/小红书@靳看看）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>鱿鱼（小红书@@小芽的成长日记）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>叉叉（乘坐火车中）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> -鱿鱼的宿舍畅想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> -清华大学的宿舍到底是什么配置啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> -看看：我可是高中就住过宿舍的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> -某美院的独特规定——大二开学统一搬宿舍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> -学校发的关于个人生活习惯的调查问卷，居然真的是有用的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> -浴室在食堂里，这到底是什么风水局？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a> -正片开始：鱿鱼和室友的故事——“室友和朋友确实是两个完全不一样的关系”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> -看看的宿舍故事——“搬宿舍后住进研究生寝室是种什么感受”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> -叉叉的宿舍故事——“保研之后分开住，是正确的、合理的、应该的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a> -和不同的人相处，需要不同的距离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> -住宿舍最难过的地方是——我们没有地方可以用来难过了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> -宿舍生活的快乐时光——和家庭背景不同的人住在一起，本身就很有趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">32:19</a> -宿舍夜谈是学术讨论？原来这才叫大学生啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">34:51</a> -宿舍追剧会出现人传人现象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">35:57</a> -在宿舍，遇到自己异父异母的异姓亲姐妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> -到底该不该和室友统一作息呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> -从“不醒人室”到“不在人室”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> -宿舍只有自己一个人时，突然感念到有室友的可贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2977">49:37</a> -齐美尔的陌生人理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">52:08</a> -穿越时空，给还没住过宿舍的自己分享一点经验</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>制作人：靳看看</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltlAET8rB7WniSBqUTpVS5R2a7FL.m4a" length="55452343" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszO3Ey6EzTGMWfrI6ighpET5hsq.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.012 清明节特辑：当然是灵异故事啦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642d39b5a79cc81470ad801b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642d39b5a79cc81470ad801b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Apr 2023 09:04:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>清明节当然要听灵异故事啦。看看和首绳收集了一些发生在自己和朋友身边的真实灵异故事再次分享，欢迎大家收听～</span></p><span></span><p><span>在此感谢提供故事内容的朋友小可、学长大白、首绳，感谢～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看看</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>首绳</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> -夜晚的卫生间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> -夜晚千万不要到处乱看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">05:14</a> -在夜间列车上看到的恐怖景象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> -有点温情，但不多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> -“你能看到那个人吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> -木匠、鬼打墙与时空循环</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> -三次搬家——是空间的问题，还是人的问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a> -首绳的夜路经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2132">35:32</a> -在没有灯的深夜撞见老人打牌——真的看得清吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作人：</span></strong><span>靳看看</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqq5asBdMs_zVdNHE2xlB6qGEfck.m4a" length="39188779" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszO3Ey6EzTGMWfrI6ighpET5hsq.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.011 民国广告——主打一个离谱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642c1e0466e4c00c6a33e1d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642c1e0466e4c00c6a33e1d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Apr 2023 12:54:27 +0000</pubDate>
