 -初代人类如何驯服白话文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2121">35:21</a> -初代广告的计价方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2179">36:19</a> -屈臣氏的起步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2346">39:06</a> -民国广告的报纸受众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2579">42:59</a> -现代广告制造的焦虑&amp;针对女性</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>制作人：</span></strong><span>靳看看</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
