    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在妇女节，我们聊一聊女性主义与婚姻制度。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看看</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>椰奶</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Coco</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a> -我们关于上野千鹤子与全嘻嘻三人访谈内容的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> -我们关于婚姻制度、生育制度的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> -婚姻不是关系，不是爱情，是制度——关于婚姻制度与父权制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> -被忽视的生育恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> -婚姻制度+生育制度——女性主体性的剥离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> -女性并没有意识到自己在被剥削</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">37:39</a> -权利平等无关生理结构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">39:04</a> -拒绝“他者化”，爱具体的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2786">46:26</a> -女性的解放一定是全人类的解放</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3119">51:59</a> -“给自己自由的最好方法是给他人自由”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3176">52:56</a> -成为女性主义者，就不会再受伤害了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3326">55:26</a> -Coco的女性主义实践&amp;看看身边的女性主义者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3855">1:04:15</a> -“一人一杀”——个人的即政治的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3959">1:05:59</a> -精英女性厌女困境——铃木凉美&amp;全嘻嘻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4072">1:07:52</a> -椰奶的理想模型——每个人都能拥有主体性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4228">1:10:28</a> -推荐的书影音&amp;想讲的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4401">1:13:21</a> -有勇气承认自己是受害者，会让自己更有力量</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书影音：</span></strong><span>《从零开始的女性主义》《厌女》《始于极限》《父权制与资本主义》《家庭、私有制和国家的起源》《弗里达》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作人</span></strong><span>@靳看看</span></p>]]></description>
