    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容也是虎年最后一期啦～这次我们一期聊了一下关于去年的种种“发疯”热点，从每个人的私人生活聊起，逐渐聊到社会新闻。我们讨论了“大学生操场爬行”、“发疯文学是否是精神释放”、“疯癫与正常是如何界定”、“道德失范是种疯癫吗”、“真正的精神病患者与他们的绘画创作”等等内容，欢迎您的收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，祝大家新年快乐！新的一年！不劳而获！无功受禄！坐享其成！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Happy Chinese New Year！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看看（微博/小宇宙/小红书@靳看看）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>椰奶（公众号@任意门童/小宇宙@亍彳）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>老李（小宇宙@木子王月㝉旦）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>首绳（啦啦啦）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Latte!!</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> -Latte：“这是我们不能触碰的滑梯”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> -老李：二旬老者，带病考研</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a> -首绳：准备去日本留学，所以在学德语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> -看看：工作室对我大门紧闭，丘比特对我唉声叹气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> -椰奶：是个INTJ，但不完全是</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> -在操场阴暗地爬行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a> -先来背诵几段发疯文学热场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> -绘画、展览与艺术疗愈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> -老李的艺术项目《归零》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> -</span><em><span>严肃讨论：</span></em><span>发疯之后——变快乐了，还是更痛苦了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> -年度新闻：梨泰院与世越号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> -年度新闻：世界杯——和其他国家的球队怎么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> -年度新闻：冬奥会&amp;谷爱凌——为什么总有人在想造神or毁神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">37:39</a> -嗯…怎么不算疯呢？疯癫的广义与狭义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> -道德失范就是疯癫吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> -真正的精神病患者与他们的生活</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>制作人：@靳看看</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
