    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>当代大学生提到原生家庭，真的很难不emo，且此emo会绵延上下两期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看看（微博/小宇宙/小红书@靳看看）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>叉叉（诈尸中）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>椰奶（公众号@任意门童/小宇宙@亍彳）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Coco（微博@茉香西瓜啵啵）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>鱿鱼（小红书@@小芽的成长日记）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> -要不要尝试改变父母？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">06:59</a> -无论在社会还是家庭中，女性都是更容易去反思的那一方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> -男性更重视同性认可</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> -社会易感性与家庭成员间的相互影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> -在新生家庭中，该如何阻断原生家庭的影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> -原生家庭潜移默化的影响——养猫与英语课问答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> -走出原生家庭后，信息源得到了更新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> -怎样才算走出了原生家庭？生孩子是什么目的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> -那些被大人当成谈资的孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a> -原生家庭对人的亲密关系有什么负面影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> -原生家庭对人的亲密关系有什么正面影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a> -经常反思的人格特质，能帮人走出原生家庭吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2594">43:14</a> -原生家庭对人的影响的形式——顺延与反弹</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>制作人：@靳看看</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
