    <guid isPermaLink="false">636cbe7ba5004aa3aa571131</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 11 Nov 2022 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看看（微博/小宇宙/小红书@靳看看）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Coco（微博@茉香西瓜啵啵）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Latte！！（@Patronus_A）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>老李（小宇宙@木子王月㝉旦）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期新青年后腿我们从消费主义谈起，聊到了消费主义与消费主义陷阱的区分；艺术、设计和大众传媒如何被消费主义裹挟；以及消费、资本对女性的剥削。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> -消费主义陷阱？我就跳我就跳！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> -消费的快乐——到底要不要克制？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">18:26</a> -资本每一步都算好了——有计划的废止制度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a> -消费即剥削——国际层面与阶级层面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2006">33:26</a> -消费很快乐，克制住了消费的欲望也很快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">37:23</a> -拍卖到底是个什么东西啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">40:47</a> -艺术品进入市场但源头？那可真是不好找</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a> -消费主义&amp;女性主义——“大女主”影视剧与Ladies Night</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2966">49:26</a> -“有毒的女子气概”、“有毒的男子气概”与被扭曲的标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> -避免冲动购买衣物的小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a> -不以物喜</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《制造消费者》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《工作、消费主义和新穷人》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《醉心于贵族的小市民》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《梦华录》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《金发梦露》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>制作人：@靳看看</span></li><s